c-plc/texas/coryell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids July to August and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 205% of normal in June to July and 58% in November to December. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 13330 got just 41% of normal that year.</p>"}
